sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant V1 as Validator A
    participant V2 as Validator B
    participant V3 as Validator C
    participant S as State store
    participant E as Event log

    C->>V1: Submit Capsule(predecessor seal, operation)
    V1->>S: Validate predecessor and nonce
    V1->>V2: Gossip Capsule
    V1->>V3: Gossip Capsule
    V2-->>V1: WitnessReceipt ACCEPT
    V3-->>V1: WitnessReceipt ACCEPT
    V1->>V1: First-Claim Lock
    alt competing capsule for same resource
        V1->>E: Append ConflictEvidence
        V1-->>C: Protocol rejection with evidence
    else quorum of witnesses
        V1->>V1: Construct ClosureProof
        V1->>S: Deterministic execution and successor root
        S-->>V1: Successor StateSeal
        V1->>E: Append closure and state transition
        V1-->>C: ClosureProof + successor seal
    end
